= William Bertozzi
{parent=List of physicists}
{c}

An experimental nuclear physicist whose <electron> speed-and-energy measurement provides a direct test of relativistic kinematics. <Bertozzi's electron speed-energy experiment> measures flight time and calorimetric <energy> independently.

Official profile: https://physics.mit.edu/faculty/william-bertozzi/

