A <physicist>.https://www.nobelprize.org/prizes/physics/1902/lorentz/biographical/[Biographical identity and professional specialization]{ref}

The <Lorentz force> connects charged-particle motion to the <electric field> and <magnetic field>. His theoretical account of the <Zeeman effect> connects that motion to changes in emitted <light>.

