\Image[https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5e/JJ_Thomson.jpg]
{title=Portrait of <Joseph John Thomson>}
{width=240}

The <Thomson charge-to-mass experiment> used electric and magnetic deflections of <cathode rays> to investigate their charged constituents. It determines a <charge-to-mass ratio>; separating <electric charge> from <mass> requires additional information.

